mote — SYFaren
==============

Help: F1 or Ctrl+H · Close: Esc
CLI: mote [file] · mote -g 1000x700 · config %APPDATA%\mote\config

Files
  Ctrl+S              Save
  Ctrl+Shift+S        Save As
  Ctrl+O              Open
  Ctrl+Q              Quit

Edit
  Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y     Undo / Redo
  Ctrl+F              Find
  F3                  Find next
  Shift+F3            Find previous
  Ctrl+G              Go to line
  Ctrl+D              Duplicate line
  Ctrl+Shift+K        Delete line
  Ctrl+]              Matching bracket
  Ctrl+A              Select all
  Ctrl+X / C / V      Cut / Copy / Paste
  Tab                 Insert tab
  Enter               New line + indent

Move
  Arrows Home End     Move caret
  PgUp / PgDn         Page
  Ctrl+Left / Right   Word jump
  Shift + move        Extend selection
  Mouse / Wheel       Select / scroll

Unsaved changes
  Ctrl+S              Save and continue
  Ctrl+Q              Discard and continue
  Esc                 Cancel
